window.MC_CONTENT_EXTRA.push({"a":"zaahen","b":"locke","win":["Skill","Locke","Locke","Zaahen","Skill","Zaahen","Skill"],"spikes":[{"when":"Lvl 2-3","text":"His bully window: marks and his missing-health on-hit bleed you before your combo assembles. Soul Ignition refunds his self-damage, so bring Grievous Wounds - concede the poke and farm safe."},{"when":"Lvl 4-5","text":"Your spike: Q Darkin Glaive poke now taxes him at range and E Golden Onslaught bursts his squishy frame - walk him down every time his E Ashen Pursuit is on cooldown."},{"when":"Lvl 6","text":"Save your R for his commit: it heals off the damage it deals, which is what wins a long fight, but spending it first hands him a free execute window."},{"when":"1st item","text":"Your bruiser item wins the duel: the heals on your Q and R out-last his one Soul Ignition window (18s) - force extended fights every wave."}],"wants":{"you":["Q Darkin Glaive chip banked between his pokes","E Golden Onslaught timed on his E cooldown","Your R held for his commit — it heals as it hits"],"foe":["Nail marks stacked before his W burst","E Ashen Pursuit resets dodging your dive","R Purgatory dropped while your R is down"]},"early":"Level 1 is even farming - his nails sting but nothing forces a trade. Levels 2-3 are his: Q Ritual Nails marks plus on-hit stakes bleed you before your kit assembles, and his E Ashen Pursuit resets slide out of the early E Golden Onslaught you try to answer with - farm with glaive from range and stay above half.","mid":"At 4-5 you take command: Q Darkin Glaive out-pokes his short range and E Golden Onslaught bursts a health pool his own W keeps burning down - punish every E-down window he shows. Level 6 is a coin-flip of held ultimates: your R Final Retribution lock deletes a Locke caught mid-combo, his R Purgatory totem executes a Zaahen who commits into it - make him flinch first.","late":"Your first bruiser item is the takeover: the heals on your Q and R plus tank stats grind through his one Soul Ignition rotation (18s at rank 1), so force long fights while the window is open. Late settles even - your two-item rotation wins any straight duel, but his R grounds your E and executes, so end fights fast and never chase him into it.","whys":["Level 1 is even farm - his nails sting but nothing forces a real trade yet.","Level 2 is his: Q Ritual Nails poke and on-hit stakes tax you before your combo is assembled.","Level 3 stays his - layered marks into W Soul Ignition burst while his E resets deny your answer.","At 4-5 you spike: Q Darkin Glaive poke and E Golden Onslaught burst punish his short range and thin frame.","Level 6 is even - your R Final Retribution lockdown against his R Purgatory totem comes down to who commits first.","On your first bruiser item the heals on your Q and R out-last his one Soul Ignition burst window, so extend.","Late settles to skill - your rotation wins straight duels, but his growing execute threshold deletes any over-extension."]});

